ADempiere Phase 5d functional modern web UI (/webui-modern).

This archive is the ZK Community Edition 10.3.0.1-jakarta slice of the ADempiere
web client. It is built from the same source tree as the rest of the product and
contains no evaluation, trial, or commercial ZK artifact.

