Scope
-----
The archive serves only the reviewed Phase 5d routes:

    login -> role selection -> desktop/menu -> read-only "Error Message" window

It is bound to the loopback-only modern runtime beside the Phase 4 CXF API WAR.
Tomcat 9 remains the only browser-facing ingress until a later phase completes
the web UI migration, so this context is not a public route.
